      "source": [
        "# Cross-Environment MLM Training Demo\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook demonstrates how to train a MolE model using **cross-environment** masked language modeling where:\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Input tokens**: Radius 0 structural atom environments\n",
        "- **Target tokens**: Radius 1 functional atom environments\n",
        "\n",
        "This approach enables the model to learn richer chemical representations by predicting functional atom environments from simpler structural ones.\n"
      ]
    }
